<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Informatika X Keramik A - Bu Ema Humaera</title>
    <!-- Google Font: Poppins -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-purple: #7C3AED;
            --secondary-purple: #4C1D95;
            --accent-yellow: #D97706;
            --glow-yellow: rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.3);
            /* Updated background gradient matching the soft light purple to white pastel aesthetic in reference image */
            --bg-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #F3E8FF 0%, #E9D5FF 35%, #F8FAFC 100%);
            --card-glass: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
            --card-glass-border: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2);
            --text-dark: #1E1B4B;
            --text-light: #64748B;
            --success-green: #10B981;
            --danger-red: #EF4444;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            margin: 0; padding: 0;
            background: var(--bg-gradient);
            background-attachment: fixed;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        /* Modal Login Glow Gradient Theme */
        .modal-overlay {
            position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background: rgba(30, 27, 75, 0.55);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;
            z-index: 1000;
        }
        .login-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
            padding: 40px; border-radius: 28px;
            width: 90%; max-width: 450px; 
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.2), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            text-align: center; border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.25);
        }
        .login-tab { display: flex; margin-bottom: 25px; border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.15); }
        .login-tab button {
            flex: 1; padding: 12px; border: none; background: none;
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; color: var(--text-light);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .login-tab button.active {
            color: var(--primary-purple); border-bottom: 4px solid var(--primary-purple);
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.2);
        }

        /* Header & Navigation UI Gradient Redesign */
        header {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            color: var(--text-dark); padding: 16px 35px;
            display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.08);
            position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;
            flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 15px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.15);
        }
        .logo-area { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px; }
        .logo { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-purple); display: flex; flex-direction: column; line-height: 1.1; }
        .logo span { font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; color: var(--secondary-purple); }
        
        .user-badge { 
            background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.1);
            color: var(--primary-purple); 
            padding: 8px 16px; 
            border-radius: 30px; 
            font-size: 13px; 
            font-weight: 600; 
            border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.3);
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.1);
        }
        
        nav { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        nav button {
            background: transparent; border: none; color: var(--text-dark);
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;
            padding: 10px 16px; border-radius: 12px; cursor: pointer; transition: 0.3s;
        }
        nav button:hover {
            background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12);
            color: var(--primary-purple);
        }
        nav button.active {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7C3AED, #9333EA);
            color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.35);
        }
        .btn-logout { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #EF4444, #DC2626) !important; color: white !important; font-weight: 600 !important; border-radius: 12px !important; padding: 8px 16px !important; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3); }
        .btn-logout:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); filter: brightness(1.1); }
        
        .btn-action-highlight {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7C3AED, #9333EA) !important;
            color: #FFFFFF !important;
            font-weight: 700 !important;
            border-radius: 12px !important;
            padding: 10px 20px !important;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.3);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .btn-action-highlight:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 25px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.45);
            filter: brightness(1.05);
        }

        /* Main Container & Sections with Glassmorphism */
        main { 
            max-width: 1250px; margin: 30px auto; padding: 35px; 
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); 
            backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
            border-radius: 28px; 
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.12), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9); 
            border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2); 
        }
        .section { display: none; }
        .section.active { display: block; animation: fadeIn 0.4s ease; }
        @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }

        /* Modern Gradient Cards & Hero */
        .card { 
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(243, 232, 255, 0.6), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9)); 
            border-left: 6px solid #7C3AED; 
            padding: 25px; border-radius: 20px; margin-bottom: 25px; 
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2); 
            border-right: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.1); 
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.1);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.05);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        }
        .hero { 
            text-align: center; padding: 50px; 
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7C3AED 0%, #8B5CF6 50%, #C084FC 100%); 
            color: white; border-radius: 24px; margin-bottom: 30px; 
            box-shadow: 0 20px 45px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.3), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.4); 
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
        }
        .hero h1 { color: #FFFFFF; margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); }
        .hero h2 { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.95; color: #F3E8FF; }

        /* Form Controls */
        .form-group { margin-bottom: 18px; text-align: left; }
        .form-group label { display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-dark); }
        .form-group input, .form-group textarea, .form-group select {
            width: 100%; padding: 14px; 
            background: #FFFFFF;
            border: 2px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.25); 
            border-radius: 14px; box-sizing: border-box; 
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; color: var(--text-dark);
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .form-group input:focus, .form-group textarea:focus, .form-group select:focus {
            border-color: #7C3AED; outline: none; 
            background: #FFFFFF;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.2);
        }
        .form-group select option { background: #FFFFFF; color: #1E1B4B; }

        .btn-submit {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7C3AED, #9333EA); color: #FFFFFF; border: none;
            padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 14px; cursor: pointer; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 600;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.3), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.35); transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .btn-submit:hover { filter: brightness(1.1); box-shadow: 0 6px 25px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.45); transform: translateY(-1px); }
        .btn-danger { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #EF4444, #DC2626); color: white; border: none; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 500; box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3); }

        /* Tables with Gradient Header & Glass Row effects */
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; }
        table, th, td { border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.15); }
        th, td { padding: 14px 18px; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-dark); }
        th { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7C3AED, #9333EA); color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; text-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); }
        tr:nth-child(even) { background-color: rgba(243, 232, 255, 0.3); }
        tr:hover { background-color: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.08); }

        .badge { padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; }
        .badge-done { background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15); color: #059669; border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3); }

        /* Embedded File Viewers */
        .file-preview {
            width: 100%; height: 550px; border: 2px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2);
            border-radius: 18px; margin-top: 12px; background: #FFFFFF; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.1);
        }
        .img-preview { max-width: 100%; max-height: 400px; border-radius: 14px; margin-top: 10px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.1); }
        .video-preview { width: 100%; max-height: 450px; border-radius: 14px; margin-top: 10px; background: #000; }
        .file-link { display: inline-block; background: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.1); color: #7C3AED; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 13px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.3); box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.08); }
        .file-link:hover { filter: brightness(1.1); background: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.18); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- MODAL LOGIN -->
    <div class="modal-overlay" id="loginModal">
        <div class="login-card">
            <h2 style="color:var(--accent-yellow); margin-bottom:5px; font-weight:700; text-shadow:0 0 15px rgba(250,204,21,0.4);">Sistem LMS Informatika</h2>
            <p style="color:var(--text-light); font-size:13px; margin-bottom:20px;">Kelas X Keramik A — Bu Ema Humaera</p>

            <div class="login-tab">
                <button class="active" onclick="switchLogin('siswa')">Akses Murid</button>
                <button onclick="switchLogin('guru')">Akses Guru / Admin</button>
            </div>

            <!-- Form Siswa -->
            <form id="formSiswa" onsubmit="loginSiswa(event)">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>Nama Lengkap Murid:</label>
                    <input type="text" id="inputNamaSiswaLogin" placeholder="Ketik Nama Lengkap Anda..." required>
                    <small style="color:var(--text-light); font-size:11px;">*Hanya murid terdaftar yang dapat masuk.</small>
                </div>
                <button type="submit" class="btn-submit" style="width:100%;">Masuk Pembelajaran</button>
            </form>

            <!-- Form Guru -->
            <form id="formGuru" onsubmit="loginGuru(event)" style="display:none;">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>PIN Akses Guru:</label>
                    <input type="password" id="inputPinGuru" placeholder="Masukkan PIN Guru" required>
                    <small style="color:var(--text-light); font-size:11px;">(PIN Default: <strong>guru123</strong>)</small>
                </div>
                <button type="submit" class="btn-submit" style="width:100%; background:linear-gradient(135deg, #4C1D95, #7C3AED);">Masuk Panel Guru</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- HEADER & NAVBAR -->
    <header>
        <div class="logo-area">
            <div style="font-size: 28px;">💻</div>
            <div class="logo">
                <span>LMS</span>
                Informatika
            </div>
            <div class="user-badge" id="userBadge">Belum Login</div>
        </div>
        <nav id="navbarMenu"></nav>
    </header>

    <!-- MAIN CONTAINER -->
    <main>

        <!-- ================= SISWA SECTIONS ================= -->
        
        <section id="s_beranda" class="section">
            <div class="hero">
                <h1>Selamat Datang Pelajar hebat di Pembelajaran Informatika!!</h1>
                <h2>Kelas Ibu Ema Humaera - X Keramik A</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3 style="color: var(--primary-purple);">📌 Petunjuk Sistem Belajar:</h3>
                <p>1. Menu <strong>Materi Ajar</strong>: Akses seluruh modul bacaan, dokumen PDF, dan presentasi PPT yang langsung tampil di layar.</p>
                <p>2. Menu <strong>Tugas & LKPD</strong>: Kerjakan lembar kerja, sematkan tautan, atau unggah file jawaban Anda (PDF, Word, PPT, Gambar, Video).</p>
                <p>3. Menu <strong>Portofolio Saya</strong>: Pantau nilai asesmen awal, proses, akhir, serta catatan dari Ibu Ema.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Menu Baru Siswa: Khusus Materi -->
        <section id="s_materi" class="section">
            <h2 style="color:var(--primary-purple);">📚 Materi Pembelajaran</h2>
            <div class="form-group" style="max-width: 400px;">
                <label>Pilih Pertemuan:</label>
                <select id="selectPertemuanMateri" onchange="loadMateriSiswa()"></select>
            </div>
            <div id="contentMateriSiswa"></div>
        </section>

        <!-- Menu Baru Siswa: Khusus Tugas & LKPD -->
        <section id="s_tugas" class="section">
            <h2 style="color:var(--primary-purple);">📝 Tugas & Lembar Kerja Peserta Didik (LKPD)</h2>
            <div class="form-group" style="max-width: 400px;">
                <label>Pilih Pertemuan:</label>
                <select id="selectPertemuanTugas" onchange="loadTugasSiswa()"></select>
            </div>
            <div id="contentTugasSiswa"></div>
        </section>

        <!-- Menu Siswa: Portofolio & Nilai Saya -->
        <section id="s_portofolio" class="section">
            <h2 style="color:var(--primary-purple);">🏆 Portofolio & Rekapitulasi Nilai Saya</h2>
            <div id="rekapPortofolioSiswa"></div>
        </section>


        <!-- ================= GURU SECTIONS ================= -->

        <!-- Guru: Portofolio Murid (Tabel Lengkap) -->
        <section id="g_portofolio" class="section">
            <h2 style="color:var(--primary-purple);">📂 Portofolio Hasil Kerja & Penilaian Murid</h2>
            <div class="card">
                <div class="form-group" style="max-width: 400px; margin-bottom: 0;">
                    <label>Filter Berdasarkan Pertemuan:</label>
                    <select id="selectFilterPertemuan" onchange="renderPortofolioTabel()">
                        <option value="ALL">-- Semua Pertemuan --</option>
                    </select>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div style="overflow-x: auto; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2);">
                <table style="min-width: 1200px;">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>Nama Murid</th>
                            <th>Kelas</th>
                            <th>Pertemuan Ke</th>
                            <th style="width: 250px;">Hasil Unggahan (LKPD/Asesmen)</th>
                            <th style="width: 100px;">Nilai Awal</th>
                            <th style="width: 100px;">Nilai Proses</th>
                            <th style="width: 100px;">Nilai Akhir</th>
                            <th style="width: 150px;">Keterangan</th>
                            <th style="width: 80px;">Aksi</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody id="tabelPortofolioGuru"></tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Guru: Daftar Pertemuan -->
        <section id="g_daftar_pertemuan" class="section">
            <h2 style="color:var(--primary-purple);">📋 Daftar Pertemuan Tersimpan</h2>
            <div class="card">
                <p>Modul pembelajaran aktif di kelas:</p>
                <div id="tabelDaftarPertemuanGuru"></div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Guru: Kelola / Buat Pertemuan -->
        <section id="g_kelola" class="section">
            <h2 style="color:var(--primary-purple);">✨ Buat / Unggah Modul Pertemuan Baru</h2>
            <div class="card">
                <form onsubmit="simpanPertemuanBaru(event)">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label>Judul Pertemuan (Contoh: Pertemuan 1 - Algoritma Searching):</label>
                        <input type="text" id="g_judulPertemuan" required>
                    </div>

                    <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap:20px; margin-bottom:15px;">
                        <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:0;">
                            <h4 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--primary-purple);">1. Materi Ajar</h4>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label>Teks Penjelasan Materi:</label>
                                <textarea id="g_materiText" rows="2"></textarea>
                                <label style="margin-top:5px;">Unggah File Materi (PDF / PPT / Gambar / Word):</label>
                                <input type="file" id="g_materiFile" accept=".pdf,.ppt,.pptx,image/*,.doc,.docx">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:0;">
                            <h4 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--primary-purple);">2. Soal & Lampiran E-LKPD</h4>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label>Instruksi LKPD:</label>
                                <textarea id="g_lkpdText" rows="2"></textarea>
                                <label style="margin-top:5px;">Sematkan Link (YouTube / Form / Web):</label>
                                <input type="url" id="g_lkpdLink" placeholder="https://contoh.com">
                                <label style="margin-top:5px;">Atau Unggah File Panduan LKPD:</label>
                                <input type="file" id="g_lkpdFile">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap:20px; margin-bottom:15px;">
                        <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:0;">
                            <h4 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--primary-purple);">3. Rubrik Penilaian</h4>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label>Teks Rubrik:</label>
                                <textarea id="g_rubrikText" rows="2"></textarea>
                                <label style="margin-top:5px;">Atau Unggah File Rubrik:</label>
                                <input type="file" id="g_rubrikFile">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:0;">
                            <h4 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--primary-purple);">4. Soal Asesmen</h4>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label>Pilih Tipe Asesmen:</label>
                                <select id="g_jenisAsesmen" style="margin-bottom:10px;">
                                    <option value="Asesmen Awal">1. Asesmen Awal</option>
                                    <option value="Asesmen Formatif">2. Asesmen Formatif</option>
                                    <option value="Asesmen Sumatif">3. Asesmen Sumatif</option>
                                </select>
                                <label>Instruksi / Soal Asesmen:</label>
                                <textarea id="g_asesmenText" rows="2"></textarea>
                                <label style="margin-top:5px;">Atau Unggah File Asesmen:</label>
                                <input type="file" id="g_asesmenFile">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <button type="submit" class="btn-submit" style="width:100%; padding:14px; font-size:16px;">Terbitkan Pertemuan</button>
                </form>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Guru: Whitelist Murid -->
        <section id="g_siswa" class="section">
            <h2 style="color:var(--primary-purple);">👥 Kelola Daftar Nama Murid (Whitelist)</h2>
            <div class="card">
                <form onsubmit="tambahSiswa(event)">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label>Input Nama Lengkap Murid Baru:</label>
                        <input type="text" id="g_namaSiswaBaru" placeholder="Contoh: Syamsul Anwar" required>
                    </div>
                    <button type="submit" class="btn-submit">Tambahkan Murid</button>
                </form>
            </div>
            <h3 style="color: var(--primary-purple);">Daftar Murid Terdaftar (X Keramik A):</h3>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr><th>No</th><th>Nama Lengkap Murid</th><th>Status Akses</th><th>Aksi</th></tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody id="tabelDaftarSiswa"></tbody>
            </table>
        </section>

        <!-- Guru: Absensi Kelas -->
        <section id="g_absensi" class="section">
            <h2 style="color:var(--primary-purple);">📊 Matriks Absensi Kelas (Daftar Hadir Pertemuan 1 - 30)</h2>
            <div class="card">
                <p>Ubah status kehadiran siswa langsung pada matriks pertemuan di bawah ini atau input tanggal pelaksanaannya:</p>
                <div style="display:flex; gap:15px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:15px;">
                    <div class="form-group" style="flex:1; min-width:200px; margin-bottom:0;">
                        <label>Pilih Pertemuan Kolom (1 - 30):</label>
                        <select id="absensiKolomPilih" onchange="renderAbsensiMatrix()"></select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group" style="flex:1; min-width:200px; margin-bottom:0;">
                        <label>Tanggal Pertemuan Terpilih:</label>
                        <input type="date" id="absensiTanggalInput" onchange="simpanTanggalAbsensi()">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Matriks Tabel Absensi -->
            <div style="overflow-x: auto; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.08); margin-top:20px; border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2);">
                <table style="min-width: 1400px; border-collapse: collapse; text-align: center; font-size: 12px;">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th rowspan="3" style="vertical-align: middle; border: 1px solid rgba(168,85,247,0.2); padding: 12px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7C3AED, #9333EA); color: white; min-width: 180px;">NAMA</th>
                            <th colspan="30" style="border: 1px solid rgba(168,85,247,0.2); padding: 8px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6D28D9, #7C3AED); color: white; font-weight: 700;">DAFTAR HADIR PERTEMUAN KE</th>
                            <th rowspan="3" style="vertical-align: middle; border: 1px solid rgba(168,85,247,0.2); background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7C3AED, #9333EA); color: white; width: 60px;">% Hdr</th>
